  "content": "<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 800px; margin: auto; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Candara', sans-serif; background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\"><div style=\"padding: 40px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 10px;\"><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\"><img src=\"{{school_logo_url}}\" style=\"height: 70px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 32px; font-weight: normal; color: #333; letter-spacing: 2px;\">{{school_name}}</h1><p style=\"margin: 5px 0 20px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #777;\">{{school_address}}</p><h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: #B71C1C;\">School Leaving Certificate</h2></div><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">This is to certify that <strong>{{student_name}}</strong> (Admission No: <strong>{{admission_no}}</strong>), son/daughter of <strong>{{father_name}}</strong>, has been a student of this institution. At the time of leaving the school, he/she was a student of class <strong>{{class_section}}</strong>. His/Her date of birth as per school records is <strong>{{dob}}</strong>.</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">He/She has cleared all outstanding dues. His/Her character and conduct during his/her stay at the school were found to be <strong>Good</strong>.</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">We wish him/her success in all future endeavors.</p><table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 70px; font-size: 15px;\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Date of Issue:</strong><br>{{current_date}}</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\"><img src=\"{{student_photo_url}}\" style=\"height: 50px;\"><br><strong style=\"border-top: 1px solid #555; padding-top: 5px;\">(Principal's Signature & Seal)</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
